{"branch":"운양점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">운양점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-7461568811720609.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"운양점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-7461568811720609.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 김포시 김포한강11로 288-37 헤리움리버테라스 205호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">김포골드라인</span><span>운양역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>운양역2번출구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>운양역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>제이엘마켓탑</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>운양역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>제이엘마켓탑</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>3-2(주말,공휴일)</span><span>33</span><span>4-1(주말)</span><span>7</span><span>8(출퇴근)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>30</span><span>한강이음1(평일)</span><span>한강이음1-1(주말)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">광역</span></dt><dd><span>M6117</span><span>M6427</span><span>M6427(예약)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">공항</span></dt><dd><span>9000</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">좌석</span></dt><dd><span>60-5</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">직행</span></dt><dd><span>6427</spa